# Day 7

**18km / 5 hours**

This was another road day, just walking to the campground before the big forest walk the day after. This involved mostly going on the road including a section of state highway 1 which is always busy and cars are travelling quickly.

![A sign helpfully indicating to drivers who to target](./road-sign.jpg)

This was definitely not a great stretch of road and I was ultra careful about cars going by and always checking where they were and getting off the road if possible. After that it was along some small rural roads where there were the typical sights.

![Some cool birds along the side of the road](./birds.jpg)

This wasn't exceptional and since I left early I ended up at my destination a bit earlier than I would have liked but that's alright, it was a nice enough day and it was a pleasant place.